# Detailed local-only README (kept out of Git; synced to Notion)
README.local.md

# Environment files and anything that must stay encrypted: never committed.
# They are handed out separately on request (see README: 환경 파일).
*.env
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*_ed25519
*_ed25519.pub
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
